---
const upcomingModules = [
  {
    name: 'Finance',
    description: 'Championship costing and cash-flow planning — know what the season costs before it starts, and where the money goes as it runs.',
  },
  {
    name: 'AI',
    description: 'Smart insights and predictions to help you prepare faster and catch issues before they happen.',
  }
];
---

<section class="band">
  <div class="page">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 class="title">
        We're building more.
      </h2>
      <p class="lede">
        RaceNode is designed to grow into a full operational platform, one module at a time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      {upcomingModules.map((module) => (
        <li class="hair pt-5">
          <span class="font-display text-sm font-medium text-graphite">Coming soon</span>
          <h3 class="subtitle mt-1">{module.name}</h3>
          <p class="muted mt-3 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">{module.description}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <p class="muted mt-12 max-w-2xl text-sm">
      These are just the next steps. JobList, Tyres, Mechanics, Setup, Run, Data... we have a roadmap that covers the full racing operation. Built by racers, for racers.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
